module.exports = /*#__PURE__*/JSON.parse('{"title":"Introducing Zappi - First Universal Payments App on Push Chain","description":"Introducing Zappi an anychain to anychain stablecoin payments app for freelancers, merchants, and businesses. Powered by PUSD, the Universal Stablecoin. Built on Push Chain.","frontMatter":{"slug":"introducing-zappi","title":"Introducing Zappi - First Universal Payments App on Push Chain","authors":["push"],"image":"./cover-image.webp","description":"Introducing Zappi an anychain to anychain stablecoin payments app for freelancers, merchants, and businesses. Powered by PUSD, the Universal Stablecoin. Built on Push Chain.","text":"Introducing Zappi an anychain to anychain stablecoin payments app for freelancers, merchants, and businesses. Powered by PUSD, the Universal Stablecoin. Built on Push Chain.","tags":["Featured","Product","Ecosystem"],"showcase":true,"twitterId":"2062546147215028296"},"content":{"id":"introducing-zappi","metadata":{"permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1233/blog/introducing-zappi","source":"@site/blog/2026-06-04-introducing-zappi/index.md","title":"Introducing Zappi - First Universal Payments App on Push Chain","description":"Introducing Zappi an anychain to anychain stablecoin payments app for freelancers, merchants, and businesses. Powered by PUSD, the Universal Stablecoin. Built on Push Chain.","date":"2026-06-04T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"Featured","permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1233/blog/tags/featured"},{"inline":true,"label":"Product","permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1233/blog/tags/product"},{"inline":true,"label":"Ecosystem","permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1233/blog/tags/ecosystem"}],"readingTime":1.74,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Push Chain","url":"https://x.com/PushChain","page":{"permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1233/blog/authors/push"},"imageURL":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1233/assets/blog/authors/authorpush.png","key":"push"}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"introducing-zappi","title":"Introducing Zappi - First Universal Payments App on Push Chain","authors":["push"],"image":"./cover-image.webp","description":"Introducing Zappi an anychain to anychain stablecoin payments app for freelancers, merchants, and businesses. Powered by PUSD, the Universal Stablecoin. Built on Push Chain.","text":"Introducing Zappi an anychain to anychain stablecoin payments app for freelancers, merchants, and businesses. Powered by PUSD, the Universal Stablecoin. Built on Push Chain.","tags":["Featured","Product","Ecosystem"],"showcase":true,"twitterId":"2062546147215028296"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Push Chain Completes Hacken Security Audit, $100,000 Bug Bounty Launching Soon","permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1233/blog/push-chain-completes-hacken-security-audit"},"nextItem":{"title":"Introducing PUSD: A Universal Stablecoin Built for the Future of Onchain Payments.","permalink":"/push-chain-website/pr-preview/pr-1233/blog/introducing-pusd"}},"content":"![Cover Image of Introducing Zappi - First Universal Payments App on Push Chain](./cover-image.webp)\\n\\n<!--truncate-->\\n\\n\\nMeet [Zappi](http://zappi.to), our newest inductee in the Push Chain Universal App ecosystem\\\\!\\n\\n[Zappi](http://zappi.to) is an anychain to anychain payments app built for freelancers, creators, and business owners of all sizes to request, receive, and settle invoices onchain.\\n\\nZappi is powered by PUSD \\\\- A universal stablecoin on Push Chain that unifies USDC and USDT liquidity across all major EVM, non EVM chains.\\n\\nHere’s what it unpacks…\\n\\n# Powered by PUSD and Push Chain\\n\\nUnder the hood, Zappi uses [PUSD](http://pusd.push.org) as its stablecoin layer.\\n\\n**PUSD is a universal stablecoin on Push Chain that provides a common dollar layer on top of crypto unifying fragmented liquidity from USDC, USDT across all popular chains.**\\n\\nUsers can deposit supported stablecoins, mint PUSD 1:1, use it across Push Chain apps, and redeem into supported stablecoins.\\n\\nThis matters because payments need a common dollar layer.\\n\\nWithout PUSD, every payment app has to think through different versions of the same dollar: USDC on one chain, USDT on another, wrapped assets, bridge flows, liquidity routes, and withdrawal preferences.\\n\\nRead [more about PUSD here](https://push.org/blog/introducing-pusd/)\\n\\n# What exactly does Zappi do?\\n\\nGlobal digital payments are now being taken over by Stablecoins.\\n\\nThese solutions are fast, secure, instant and incredibly cheaper than traditional SWIFT/ACH counterparts. And they run 24x7.\\n\\nBut stablecoins are still isolated within chain boundaries. USDC on Solana and USDC on Ethereum may represent the same dollar value, but they are not automatically interchangeable in practice.\\n\\nAnd this is a huge bottleneck that very few teams are trying to solve.\\n\\n*A user might have USDC on Base.*\\n*The recipient might prefer USDT on another chain.*\\n*The app might support only one network.*\\n*The payment might need a bridge, a swap, multiple approvals, extra gas, and a lot of waiting.*\\n\\nThat is too much friction for something as simple as “send $100.”\\n\\nStablecoin payments should feel simple: create a request, share a link, receive funds.\\n\\n**Paid from any supported stablecoin, through any chain.**\\n\\nThat is what Zappi is designed for.\\n\\n# How can I use Zappi?\\n\\n<iframe width=\\"100%\\" style={{aspectRatio: \'16/9\'}} src=\\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/P8Y3wIrCN74\\" title=\\"How to use Zappi\\" frameborder=\\"0\\" allow=\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\" referrerpolicy=\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\\n\\n# Where can I use Zappi?\\n\\nZappi makes stablecoin payments easier for:\\n\\n* freelancers collecting payments from global clients\\n* businesses accepting crypto payments\\n* creators receiving tips or support\\n* teams splitting bills or collecting contributions\\n* apps and communities that need simple stablecoin checkout flows\\n\\nJoin our [merchant network](https://zappi.to/m/register) today\\\\!\\n\\n# Start using Zappi\\n\\nWith [Zappi](http://zappi.to), users can create payment links, accept supported stablecoins, settle in PUSD, and earn safest yields through PUSD+.\\n\\nIt is a simple idea: global payments should not break because the sender and receiver are on different chains.\\n\\nIf you\'re a developer building in the payments or other cool industries and want to build using Push Chain and PUSD, [reach out to us here](https://t.me/+0PvJa9Kzfto5MWE9)."},"twitterId":"2062546147215028296"}');

